@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Hourly rental
+
+Equipment can have an optional `hourlyPrice` (euro cents per hour). A rental shorter than a day that starts
+and ends on the hour (UTC) costs hours x hourly price, with no discount. An item without an hourly price
+cannot be rented by the hour. Rentals of a day or more still start and end at midnight UTC and are priced
+per day.
+
+## Open questions (to settle with /speckit-clarify)
+
+- Opening hours: any hour of the day is accepted, as no opening hours are stated.
+- Hourly price above the daily price: a long afternoon can cost more than a day. Not capped until the school decides.
+- A rental of a day or more that is not at midnight (e.g. 10:00 to 10:00 next day) is rejected.
+- Whether the season (April to October) limits bookings is not enforced, as before.
